* /**
*  * @file GETOPT.SENTENCE
*  * @version 1.1
*  */
* Portable command-line fetch — the one platform seam.  Native MVX reads it from
* SENTENCE(); every MV vendor reads @SENTENCE.  The MV define comes from mvpkg's
* shared PLATFORM.H via the MVPKG.INC pointer (MVX is builtin, so MV is absent
* there); getopt therefore depends on mvpkg having provisioned the account.
SUBROUTINE GETOPT.SENTENCE(S)
$INCLUDE MVPKG.INC PLATFORM.H
$IFDEF MV
S = TRIM(@SENTENCE)
$ELSE
S = TRIM(SENTENCE())
$ENDIF
RETURN
